## Troubleshooting

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| Skills missing | Restart Claude Code |
| Plugins outdated | `specweave refresh-plugins` |
| Out of sync | `/sw:sync-progress` |
| Session stuck | `rm -f .specweave/state/*.lock` + restart |
